iner></span> is\nnondegenerate then so is its restriction to <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"H^{\\perp_\\beta}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em; margin-left: 0.053em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22A5\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D6FD TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>H</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><msub><mo>⊥</mo><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>","file":"ch14-forms/09-symplectic-forms.html"}